  "description": "Emulates a curved CRT display rather than tape damage: radial screen curvature, horizontal scanlines, a subtle RGB aperture-grille phosphor structure, brightness compensation, rounded-screen corner falloff, and edge darkening. The default treatment is calibrated to preserve image detail while still reading as a CRT; Phosphor Mask can be pushed higher for close-up tube texture. Use Mix to blend with the original.",
